# == AIE6001(Fall 2026): Advanced Math for AI


Welcome to the class website of */AIE6001(Fall 2026): Advanced Math for AI/* at *The Chinese University of Hong Kong*!

Our class meets every *Monday morning, 9:00-11:30am*. The class location is *TBA*.

For complete course policies, learning outcomes, grading, and reference texts, see the [syllabus.html Course Syllabus].


